######################################################################

### 5a. Harry tries to remove Alex using Harry's key -> 403, nothing changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave
X-API-KEY: {{harryKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": {{alexId}}, "groupId": {{groupId}} }

### 5b. Alex leaves -> 200, numMembers 2 -> 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave
X-API-KEY: {{alexKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": {{alexId}}, "groupId": {{groupId}} }

### 5c. Same leave again (client retry) -> 200, nothing changes
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave
X-API-KEY: {{alexKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": {{alexId}}, "groupId": {{groupId}} }

### 5d. Missing groupId -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/leave
X-API-KEY: {{alexKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": {{alexId}} }


